{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.GenerationCompleteness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.GenerationCompleteness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.generation_completeness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.generation_completeness","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L104-L118","doc":"**Generation completeness** (Theorem):\n\nLet `K` be any knot type with Seifert genus `g(K) ≤ 4`.  Then `K` is\nreachable from the generator set `𝒢` by a finite sequence of Skein\ncrossing changes.\n\nThe genus hypothesis is the scope of the spectrum and is not consumed\nby the proof (see the module docstring); the content is\n`reachable_of_unknotting`, i.e. `GenerationScheme.unknotting_realised`\ncomposed with `unknot_generator`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:generation-completeness","label":"thm:generation-completeness","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.reachable_of_unknotting","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.reachable_of_unknotting","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L98-L102","doc":"Every knot type is reachable from `𝒢`: the unknot is a generator and the\nunknotting number realises `k` from it.  This is the theorem's real\ncontent, without the scope hypothesis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.Reachable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.Reachable","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L93-L96","doc":"A knot type is **reachable from `𝒢`** if some generator reaches it by a\nfinite sequence of Skein crossing changes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.isEmbeddable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.isEmbeddable","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L90-L91","doc":"A knot type is embeddable if its Seifert genus is within the bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknotting_realised","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknotting_realised","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L86-L86","doc":"**The defining property of the unknotting number** (Kauffman): every\nknot type is obtained from the unknot by exactly `u(K)` crossing\nchanges.  This is the field that carries the geometric content; the\ntheorem below does not re-derive it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknottingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknottingNumber","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Unknotting number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.seifertGenus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.seifertGenus","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L78-L78","doc":"Seifert genus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.crossingChange","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.crossingChange","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L76-L76","doc":"One Skein crossing change. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknot_generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknot_generator","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L74-L74","doc":"`T_{1,0} ∈ 𝒢`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.unknot","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L72-L72","doc":"The unknot `T_{1,0}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.isGenerator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.isGenerator","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L70-L70","doc":"Membership in the generator set `𝒢`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme.mk","kind":"ctor","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.GenerationScheme","kind":"structure","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L64-L86","doc":"**A generation scheme** over a type `K` of knot types: the generator\nset `𝒢`, the unknot `T_{1,0} ∈ 𝒢`, the one-step Skein crossing-change\nrelation, the two invariants the theorem mentions, and the defining\nproperty of the unknotting number. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.eq_of_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.eq_of_zero","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L57-L62","doc":"Zero steps reach exactly the starting point (sanity: the step count is\nmeaningful). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.step","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L54-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn.refl","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ReachableIn","kind":"inductive","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L50-L55","doc":"`ReachableIn r n a b`: `b` is obtained from `a` by **exactly `n`** steps\nof the one-step relation `r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.genusBound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.genusBound","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/generation-completeness.lean#L47-L48","doc":"The genus bound for the Bring's surface. ","signatureChunk":0}]}